[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10920.71, "timestamp": "03:02:00", "text": "与我的未来有关"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10923.91, "timestamp": "03:02:03", "text": "但随着时间的推移，我就想，好吧，我去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10926.07, "timestamp": "03:02:06", "text": "这段音乐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10928.71, "timestamp": "03:02:08", "text": "所以我就想，好吧，我能做到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10934.55, "timestamp": "03:02:14", "text": "我当时也在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10936.95, "timestamp": "03:02:16", "text": "我从没想过要去日本。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10939.83, "timestamp": "03:02:19", "text": "其实我只是随机的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10943.349, "timestamp": "03:02:23", "text": "我当时就想，嗯，我对那里很感兴趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10945.821, "timestamp": "03:02:25", "text": "我曾想过去学一门语言课。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10948.309, "timestamp": "03:02:28", "text": "音乐课程就像学习这个一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10950.309, "timestamp": "03:02:30", "text": "那样做。我从没想过我会不得不……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10954.55, "timestamp": "03:02:34", "text": "去那里什么的。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10957.51, "timestamp": "03:02:37", "text": "随着时间的推移，我感觉就像看到了我的父母"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10960.23, "timestamp": "03:02:40", "text": "我应该感到高兴，因为我正在学习一些东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10961.91, "timestamp": "03:02:41", "text": "对音乐感兴趣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10963.99, "timestamp": "03:02:43", "text": "他们已经知道我会说这种语言了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10967.03, "timestamp": "03:02:47", "text": "中文、日文或其他什么语言"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10968.95, "timestamp": "03:02:48", "text": "他们当时就说，哦，他很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10971.11, "timestamp": "03:02:51", "text": "实际上，他一直追随自己的兴趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10973.83, "timestamp": "03:02:53", "text": "与其浪费时间，不如做点别的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10976.71, "timestamp": "03:02:56", "text": "你以为你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10979.349, "timestamp": "03:02:59", "text": "呃"}]